{"overview":"میما کیری‌گوئه، ستارهٔ پاپ در حال صعود، برای دنبال کردن کار بازیگری آوازخوانی را رها می‌کند. پس از ایفای نقش در یک سریال کارآگاهی محبوب، دستیاران و همکاران او به‌تدریج کشته می‌شوند. میما که با احساس گناه و رؤیای خودِ قبلی دست و پنجه نرم می‌کند، واقعیت و خیالش در هم می‌آمیزند و به پارانویا و دیوانگی می‌انجامند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Rising pop star Mima Kirigoe quits singing to pursue a career as an actress. After she takes up a role on a popular detective show, her handlers and collaborators begin turning up murdered. Harboring feelings of guilt and haunted by visions of her former self, Mima's reality and fantasy meld into a frenzied paranoia.","tagline_en":"\"excuse me... who are you?\"","runtime":81,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["今敏"],"crew_en":["Satoshi Kon"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"岩男潤子","role":"Mima Kirigoe (voice)","photo":"/bKyMLT1MgDTnXafsq2ur32VMwY5.jpg","en":"Junko Iwao"},{"name":"松本梨香","role":"Rumi (voice)","photo":"/8kGjV2Ke6MVaR2UGtO9YpFkvuTu.jpg","en":"Rica Matsumoto"},{"name":"新山志保","role":"Rei (voice)","photo":"/pP8onCIEUgXMyEQIADMkAvQfMrk.jpg","en":"Shiho Niiyama"},{"name":"大倉正章","role":"Mamoru Uchida (voice)","photo":"/lQmV0Nzww7i3cmbr2ToqGJ5q6qr.jpg","en":"Masaaki Okura"},{"name":"辻親八","role":"Tadokoro (voice)","photo":"/af5ILJbixauO84bsuLOr8XSU9yd.jpg","en":"Shinpachi Tsuji"},{"name":"Emiko Furukawa","role":"Yukiko (voice)","photo":""},{"name":"秋元羊介","role":"Tejima (voice)","photo":"/uzBTKym7osTko49r5odq86nPKT5.jpg","en":"Yosuke Akimoto"},{"name":"塩屋翼","role":"Takao Shibuya (voice)","photo":"/zJCaOJWub2g8ZlXuH8vE9yaBVy1.jpg","en":"Yoku Shioya"},{"name":"堀秀行","role":"Sakuragi (voice)","photo":"/fbWWkhe7GVSlhBljY89rJd01OnA.jpg","en":"Hideyuki Hori"},{"name":"امی شینوهارا","role":"Eri Ochiai (voice)","photo":"/ryGauSE9aoEh5DFMrlFw3H8sATC.jpg","en":"Emi Shinohara"},{"name":"江原正士","role":"Murano (voice)","photo":"/xJPCatQLQi75zc9YfWZo0gSpynq.jpg","en":"Masashi Ebara"},{"name":"梁田清之","role":"K